# src/

Root module for the Udex API library. Exports gRPC service definitions, client/server stubs, and utility functions for timestamp conversion and context hashing. Organized into authorization enforcement, generated protobuf bindings, and core utilities.

## Dirs

- `authz/` -- Authorization and permission enforcement for gRPC services
- `generated/` -- Auto-generated Rust code from Protocol Buffer definitions

## Files

- `lib.rs` -- Main library exports, gRPC re-exports, and timestamp conversion utilities
- `hash.rs` -- xxHash-based context hashing with deterministic pair ordering
